<title>UK: Britain backs Zimbabwe airport contract.</title>
<headline>Britain backs Zimbabwe airport contract.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Export Credits Guarantee Department (ECGD) on Tuesday said it was backing an order by a British firm as part of a project to develop the Harare International Airport.</p>
<p>The ECGD is guaranteeing a 30.5 million stg loan to finance Edmund Nuttall Ltd's part in a contract to design and construct a new terminal and control tower at the airport. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
